                <li><a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/7LrEF4uSBQSopMZE3DNaan" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-teal text-white px-4 py-2 rounded text-xs font-bold hover:bg-white hover:text-teal transition">Listen</a></li>
